    "title": "Southern Boone volleyball advances to district semifinals with sweep",
    "text": "No. 4 Southern Boone volleyball knocked off No. 5 Kirksville in the district quarterfinals in three straight sets (25-18, 25-23, 25-15) Wednesday to advance to the semifinals.\nJunior outside hitter Camryn Seymour led the team in kills with 11. Senior outside hitter Kate Taylor was the other Eagles player with double-digit kills with 10. Sophomore Payton Germann was the catalyst of the offense with 23 assists along with with two kills and seven digs. Senior libero Sadie Ahern led the team with 16 digs in the match.",
